{"version":1,"content":"<p>海關昨日（21日）在觀塘執行反私煙行動，在觀塘一工廈單位破獲私煙分銷中心，共檢獲約5萬支懷疑私煙，市值約22萬元，應課稅值約16萬元，並拘捕一對夫婦。</p><p>被捕32歲男子及40歲女子已被落案起訴相關罪名，案件將於下月25日在觀塘裁判法院提堂。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:39.645027+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T04:49:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T10:38:03.984486+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:17:39.645027+00:00","content_hash":"85cb76c8386d40dd6ac27c4ede27c4c68bad376f8cb8b79523f715256fbbb3c6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}